    <string name="transcription_p1">The integration of Material 3 design principles allows for a more personal and expressive user interface. In this transcription tool, we focus on the core user journey: capturing clear audio and presenting it in a highly readable format.</string>
    <string name="transcription_p2">Notice how the typography scales are utilized to create a clear visual hierarchy. We use Manrope for headings to give it a modern, tech-forward feel, while Inter handles the heavy lifting of the transcription text itself…</string>
    <string name="transcription_ambient">(Ambient noise: keyboard typing)</string>
    <string name="transcription_p3">By leveraging surface-container colors instead of harsh shadows, the interface feels integrated and native to the OS environment. This tonal elevation strategy reduces cognitive load during long recording sessions.</string>
